    <node id="Direct Psychological Support">
      <data key="d0">Direct Psychological Support</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Low-risk, non-diagnostic direct psychological support intended for adolescents.&lt;SEP&gt;The type of support that Mentalization Stance is used for, characterized as low-risk and non-diagnostic.&lt;SEP&gt;A low-risk, non-diagnostic form of psychological assistance; scope for the described guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-diagnostic psychological assistance for low-risk cases; scope of the guidelines.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-c67b74097efa61deeed03804-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5160492e097bac38980aeda-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2526c2542d1fb9e5640b1a30-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-004</data>
