      <data key="d0">Applicable Clues</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Indicators for applying the topic: inability to name emotions, unawareness of emotion meaning, and difficulty in emotion regulation.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cf58af1984b50a1dcb11591e-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">GUIDANCE-TOPIC-AFFECT-IDENTIFICATION.md</data>
