      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of indicators for high emotional arousal, including elevated emotional temperature, non-mentalizing behavior, enhanced stress response, enhanced social exclusion response, and enhanced academic stress response.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2526c2542d1fb9e5640b1a30-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">GUIDANCE-TOPIC-AROUSAL.md</data>
