      <data key="d0">Treatment Agenda</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The planned sequence of therapeutic interventions; ignoring emotional temperature while continuing treatment agenda is listed as an avoidance.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2526c2542d1fb9e5640b1a30-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">GUIDANCE-TOPIC-AROUSAL.md</data>
