    <node id="Evolutionary Mismatch">
      <data key="d0">Evolutionary Mismatch</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A theoretical explanation for adaptation difficulties in adolescents, due to a lack of adult role models and an imbalance between responsibility and autonomy in modern society.&lt;SEP&gt;Mismatch between current environment and evolutionary adaptations, including lack of adult roles and imbalance of responsibility and autonomy.&lt;SEP&gt;Mismatch between evolved adaptations and modern environment; concept relevant to adolescent development.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-000</data>
