    </node>
    <node id="Autonomy">
      <data key="d0">Autonomy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A developmental task for adolescents, involving the desire for independence, which may lead to conflicts with family.&lt;SEP&gt;The abstract idea of self-governance and independence, the development of which has not kept pace with the extension of modern education.&lt;SEP&gt;Independence and self-governance; key aspect of adolescent development mentioned in keywords.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-003</data>
      <data key="d4">GUIDANCE-TOPIC-ADOLESCENT-DEVELOPMENT.md</data>
      <data key="d5">1784707469</data>
