    </node>
    <node id="Peer Relationships">
      <data key="d0">Peer Relationships</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A developmental task for adolescents, involving forming and maintaining relationships with peers, often prioritized over family.&lt;SEP&gt;Social relationships with peers, which become particularly important during adolescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Social connections with peers; key aspect of adolescent development mentioned in keywords.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-003</data>
