      <data key="d0">Goal of Helping Adolescents Understand Behavior</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An objective to assist adolescents in comprehending the developmental functions of their actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">GUIDANCE-TOPIC-ADOLESCENT-DEVELOPMENT.md</data>
