    <node id="Goal of Helping Adolescents Understand Behavior and Promote Adaptive Development">
      <data key="d0">Goal of Helping Adolescents Understand Behavior and Promote Adaptive Development</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An objective to assist adolescents in understanding their behavior and developmental function, promoting adaptive developmental trajectories, enhancing autonomy and agency, while avoiding pathologization.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-cbd65c5b9066cfdab9aefc4e-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">GUIDANCE-TOPIC-ADOLESCENT-DEVELOPMENT.md</data>
      <data key="d5">1784707469</data>
